{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891940/extras/de8d160022cb8fd639257a6cff9fe21b.avif?t=1760036561\" width=500 height=500 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to Path of the Sphere (PotS)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the intensity of life and roll into the maze \ud83d\ude2e\u200d\ud83d\udca8. Path of the Sphere is a a relaxing labyrinth game where you guide a colorful sphere through 35 levels of mazes. No pressure, no deadlines, no conflicts. Just soothing gameplay in your own way and at your own pace.\u00a0\ud83d\ude0c</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES OF THE GAME</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf43 35 levels of labyrinth at start </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcdf Endless levels on request</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2699\ufe0f Customise your experience with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Music (Calm for a more relaxing play or Intense to spark your challenging side)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd09 Sound effects (hear the ball roll or turn it to enjoy just the music)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd58 Timer (Display it digitally or in a classic analog style)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f Minimap (Switch it on for smoother play, or off for extra challenge)</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f Level Select panel to replay your favourites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2328\ufe0f Keyboard friendly controls (WASD and arrow keys)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udccb In-game updates panel so you're always informed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf38 Tap Illaza, our chibi mascot, in the main menu to visit our socials</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHO SHOULD PLAY?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There is something for everyone in PotS </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd13 Educational benefits: logical thinking, spatial awareness, emotional regulation, independent learning and improved memory </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude0c Classic Mode offers a sensory friendly alternative to high intensity games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > \ud83d\ude2e\u200d\ud83d\udca8 Helps unwind and release tension after a long day</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udec2 Enjoy it with friends or family. A game that people of all ages can enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891940/extras/6699dbaf0a174f5356068b369dbb3016.avif?t=1760036561\" width=920 height=430 /></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3891940?t=1760036561","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891940/4d4c7d74b9216aa05db20af0f5d0d93561f24ba8/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760036561","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891940/bbb99813333f206de3e593a276615aa923405893/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760036561","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3891940/bbb99813333f206de3e593a276615aa923405893/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760036561","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detaile